ℹ️ No test script configured in package.json

## Next Steps

To activate Speed Insights on Vercel:
1. Deploy this updated code to Vercel
2. Navigate to your project's Speed Insights settings in the Vercel dashboard
3. Click the "Enable" button
4. The tracking routes (`/_vercel/speed-insights/*`) will be automatically configured
5. Verify the tracking script appears in your deployed page's HTML

## Package Manager
Used npm (as indicated by package-lock.json presence) for all dependency management.

